  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 145 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Vecuronium bromide has been on FDA's shortage list since 2020-05-06 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a duration of 78 months.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our current supply includes labels naming Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited and Sun Pharmaceutical Industries Limited, both of which are registered plants for this product.",
      "cites": ["E23", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1112832 at Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited ended 2019-12-13 and was classified OAI, 145 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2020-05-06.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sun Pharmaceutical Industries Limited has a history of OAI inspections, including inspection 1112832 ending 2019-12-13 and inspection 1272871 ending 2025-06-13, both classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited received an OAI classification letter dated 2026-09-21, 2329 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The preferred purchasing option per rule is to buy from Mylan Institutional LLC, whose product is not on FDA's shortage list today and is manufactured at MYLAN LABS LTD.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An approved therapeutic interchange exists for the same product from Gland Pharma Limited (NDC 68083013910), approved by Jordan Hale, PharmD on 2026-01-27.",
      "cites": ["D13", "E42"]
    }
  ]
}
